  "description": "After a long struggle, Jihoon, an ordinary 29-year-old man, finally lands a job at a liquor company. He dreams of a happy future with his girlfriend Yejin, who has faithfully stayed by his side for six years. However, beginning with Sohee, his team leader who possesses a mature charm completely opposite to Yejin’s, Jihoon becomes entangled with various women through alcohol… And little by little, his youth starts to spiral out of control.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
